{"id":"050e3997281664f2","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-quotient-algebra.md","title":"Σ代数的商构造","display":"df-quotient-algebra — Σ代数的商构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-quotient-algebra","aliases":["56-df-quotient-algebra"],"display":"df-quotient-algebra — Σ代数的商构造","depends_on":["[[56-df-sigma-congruence]]"],"source_section":"7.1.9","source_pages":"263","source_ocr_blocks":[284],"source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-quotient-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-quotient-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-algebra — Σ代数的商构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8f6f121e8472779\" href=\"?note=d8f6f121e8472779\" title=\"56-df-sigma-congruence\">56-df-sigma-congruence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.9"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"263"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>284</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8f6f121e8472779\" href=\"?note=d8f6f121e8472779\" title=\"56-df-sigma-congruence\">56-df-sigma-congruence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>。方括号记下列定义的等价类，不表示任选代表元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[a]_Q\\coloneqq\\{b\\in A:(a,b)\\in Q\\},\\qquad A/Q\\coloneqq\\{[a]_Q:a\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[a]_Q\\coloneqq\\{b\\in A:(a,b)\\in Q\\},\\qquad A/Q\\coloneqq\\{[a]_Q:a\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_Q(f)\\coloneqq\\{(( [a_1]_Q,\\ldots,[a_n]_Q),[I(f)(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)]_Q):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in A^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_Q(f)\\coloneqq\\{(( [a_1]_Q,\\ldots,[a_n]_Q),[I(f)(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)]_Q):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in A^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_Q\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_Q(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\coloneqq(A/Q,I_Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_Q\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_Q(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\coloneqq(A/Q,I_Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_Q\\coloneqq\\{(a,[a]_Q):a\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_Q\\coloneqq\\{(a,[a]_Q):a\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 7.1.9。用全部代表元构成运算图，代表元无关性由同余条件保证，详见本簇商代数良定义性命题。A/Q 非空；零元输入沿用空元组。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.9，印刷页 263。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-sigma-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6f121e8472779","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6f121e8472779","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$，$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$，且 $\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$，见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。$a\\in A$、$f\\in F$。方括号记下列定义的等价类，不表示任选代表元。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"[a]_Q\\coloneqq\\{b\\in A:(a,b)\\in Q\\},\\qquad A/Q\\coloneqq\\{[a]_Q:a\\in A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I_Q(f)\\coloneqq\\{(( [a_1]_Q,\\ldots,[a_n]_Q),[I(f)(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)]_Q):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\in A^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I_Q\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_Q(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\coloneqq(A/Q,I_Q).","display":true},{"tex":"q_Q\\coloneqq\\{(a,[a]_Q):a\\in A\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f90a5c149724deb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-thm-equational-congruence]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,E,Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V},G,Q_G$ 及项构造运算 $I_T,I_G$。商构造见 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]。基项模型的定义域显式限于 $G\\ne\\varnothing$ 的参数实例。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-quotient-algebra.md]]"},{"id":"ee77de74c708cdc0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$。$(A/Q,I_Q)$、$[a]_Q$、$q_Q$ 取 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]，同态取 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]；$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$。"}],"outgoing":["d8f6f121e8472779"]}